# Web Clone Tester Skill

Skill để verify và test clone website - đảm bảo clone giống bản gốc về cả giao diện và chức năng.

## Khi nào sử dụng

- Sau khi clone một website, verify độ chính xác
- Khi cần so sánh clone với original
- Khi cần đảm bảo tất cả features hoạt động
- Khi cần report differences giữa clone và original

## Test Categories

### 1. Visual Comparison Tests
- Screenshot comparison
- Layout structure verification
- Color/typography matching
- Spacing/alignment verification

### 2. Functional Tests
- Navigation links work
- Forms submit correctly
- Buttons trigger actions
- Modals open/close
- Animations work

### 3. Responsive Tests
- Mobile viewport (320px - 480px)
- Tablet viewport (768px - 1024px)
- Desktop viewport (1920px+)
- Breakpoint behavior

### 4. Content Tests
- All text content present
- All images load
- Fonts render correctly
- Icons display properly

### 5. Performance Tests
- Load time
- Resource sizes
- Request count
- Lighthouse scores

## Test Workflow

### Phase 1: Setup Comparison Environment

```bash
# Mở original website
"$PWCLI" open https://original-website.com

# Snapshot original
"$PWCLI" snapshot
"$PWCLI" screenshot original-full.png

# Resize to standard desktop
"$PWCLI" resize 1920 1080
"$PWCLI" screenshot original-desktop.png
```

### Phase 2: Open Clone

```bash
# Mở clone trong new tab
"$PWCLI" tab-new file:///{path}/clone-project/index.html

# Snapshot clone
"$PWCLI" snapshot
"$PWCLI" screenshot clone-full.png

# Resize to same viewport
"$PWCLI" resize 1920 1080
"$PWCLI" screenshot clone-desktop.png
```

### Phase 3: Visual Comparison

#### 3.1 Side-by-Side Screenshots

```bash
# Original viewport screenshot
"$PWCLI" tab-select 0
"$PWCLI" resize 1920 1080
"$PWCLI" screenshot comparison-original.png

# Clone viewport screenshot
"$PWCLI" tab-select 1
"$PWCLI" resize 1920 1080
"$PWCLI" screenshot comparison-clone.png
```

#### 3.2 DOM Structure Comparison

```bash
# Get original DOM
"$PWCLI" tab-select 0
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  bodyChildren: document.body.children.length,
  mainElements: document.querySelectorAll('main, article, section').length,
  navItems: document.querySelectorAll('nav a').length,
  forms: document.querySelectorAll('form').length,
  buttons: document.querySelectorAll('button, .btn').length,
  images: document.querySelectorAll('img').length,
  links: document.querySelectorAll('a').length
})"

# Get clone DOM
"$PWCLI" tab-select 1
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  bodyChildren: document.body.children.length,
  mainElements: document.querySelectorAll('main, article, section').length,
  navItems: document.querySelectorAll('nav a').length,
  forms: document.querySelectorAll('form').length,
  buttons: document.querySelectorAll('button, .btn').length,
  images: document.querySelectorAll('img').length,
  links: document.querySelectorAll('a').length
})"
```

#### 3.3 CSS Comparison

```bash
# Original CSS variables
"$PWCLI" tab-select 0
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  rootVars: Array.from(document.querySelector(':root').style).filter(p => p.startsWith('--')),
  fonts: getComputedStyle(document.body).fontFamily,
  colors: {
    primary: getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--primary') || getComputedStyle(document.body).color,
    background: document.body.style.background || getComputedStyle(document.body).backgroundColor
  }
})"

# Clone CSS variables
"$PWCLI" tab-select 1
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  rootVars: Array.from(document.querySelector(':root').style).filter(p => p.startsWith('--')),
  fonts: getComputedStyle(document.body).fontFamily,
  colors: {
    primary: getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--primary') || getComputedStyle(document.body).color,
    background: document.body.style.background || getComputedStyle(document.body).backgroundColor
  }
})"
```

### Phase 4: Functionality Tests

#### 4.1 Navigation Test

```bash
# Test clone navigation
"$PWCLI" tab-select 1
"$PWCLI" eval "Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('a[href]')).map(a => ({
  text: a.textContent.trim().substring(0, 30),
  href: a.href,
  valid: a.href !== '#' && a.href !== ''
}))"
```

#### 4.2 Form Test

```bash
# Test form existence and fields
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify(Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('form')).map(f => ({
  id: f.id || f.className,
  action: f.action,
  method: f.method,
  fields: Array.from(f.querySelectorAll('input, select, textarea')).map(i => ({
    name: i.name,
    type: i.type || i.tagName.toLowerCase(),
    required: i.required
  }))
})))"
```

#### 4.3 Interactive Elements Test

```bash
# Test buttons and clickable elements
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  buttons: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button, [role=button], .btn, [class*=button]')).map(b => ({
    text: b.textContent.trim().substring(0, 20),
    hasHandler: !!b.onclick || b.hasAttribute('data-action') || b.hasAttribute('ng-click') || b.hasAttribute('@click')
  })),
  modals: Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[class*=modal], [class*=dialog]')).map(m => ({
    trigger: m.id || m.className.substring(0, 30)
  }))
})"
```

### Phase 5: Responsive Tests

```bash
# Mobile (320px)
"$PWCLI" tab-select 1
"$PWCLI" resize 320 568
"$PWCLI" snapshot
"$PWCLI" screenshot responsive-mobile.png

# Check if hamburger menu appears
"$PWCLI" eval "JSON.stringify({
  viewport: { width: window.innerWidth, height: window.innerHeight },
  hamburger: !!document.querySelector('.hamburger, .menu-toggle, [class*=hamburger]'),
